==================================================\
ACCURACY\
==================================================\
\
Accuracy determines catch consistency.\
\
Higher Accuracy directly increases successful catches.\
\
Accuracy caps at 100 for catch calculations.\
\
Any Accuracy earned beyond 100 becomes Focus.\
\
