\
==================================================\
FOCUS EFFECTS\
==================================================\
\
Focus has two stages.\
\
Stage 1\
\
Focus first reduces stamina consumption.\
\
Every point of Focus slightly decreases stamina cost.\
\
Once every action already costs only 1 stamina, no further reduction is possible.\
\
Stage 2\
\
After stamina cost reaches its minimum, Focus instead improves the Perfect Catch window.\
\
For every 10 Focus above 100:\
\
Perfect Catch window expands by\
\
+1 frame before perfect\
\
+1 frame after perfect\
\
Examples\
\
Focus = 110\
\
Perfect window\
\
+1 frame\
\uc0\u8722 1 frame\
\
Focus = 150\
\
Perfect window\
\
+5 frames\
\uc0\u8722 5 frames\
\
Focus = 200\
\
Perfect window\
\
+10 frames\
\uc0\u8722 10 frames\
\
This ensures Accuracy remains valuable even late into the game.\
\
==================================================\
PERFECT CATCHS\
==================================================\
\
Perfect Catch timing is intentionally simple for now.\
\
Future possibility:\
\
Accuracy could influence catch quality, not only catch success.\
\
This idea is worth revisiting later but should not be implemented yet.\
