==================================================\
CORE PROGRESSION LOOP\
==================================================\
\
Strength unlocks capability.\
\
Accuracy unlocks consistency.\
\
Player skill unlocks high scores.\
\
Character progression improves the player's potential.\
\
Economic progression unlocks better equipment and opportunities.\
\
Mechanical skill determines how much of that potential the player can actually realize.\
\
The goal is that statistics never replace skill, but instead reward the player by making increasingly ambitious performances possible.\
